Third-party data included
-------------------------

configs/audio/opus-transport-trace-20260906.json contains Opus packets
encoded from two recordings on Wikimedia Commons (speaker: Шантопик; text by
A. S. Pushkin), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). The file is an adapted work
under the same license; its "attribution" field lists the sources and changes:

- File:Ru-Что_в_имени_тебе_моем.ogg (oldid 1041724217)
- File:Ru-Если_жизнь_тебя_обманет.ogg (oldid 1041723381)

The audio files themselves are not included; the listening scripts download
them from the pinned sources in configs/audio/listening-20260906.json.

